  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "hear me out.\n\nImagine having the ability to buy V-Credits and pay people for their services. even being able to tip servers, host, bartenders, and dancers.\n\ngroup owners could pay their moderators for keeping their instances clean and safe.\n\nImagine running a role-play group and you have actors who don't show up all the time. well if they're getting paid for their time it'd make them second guess of showing up or not. \n\ncould be a great idea as a gift for someone's birthday or as a Christmas present. People who have the funds could finally spoil their friends or be a kind stranger to someone in need.\n\ndoes anyone else think this is a good idea? if so please help me make this real.",
